{"id":1110201,"chapter_id":1110201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，您的电话。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201002,"trial_step":2},{"step":2,"content":"夜莺将听筒递到你的手上。电话来自大名鼎鼎的蛇眼——一家受雇于新城上流圈子的PMC公司，在业界地位颇高。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201003,"trial_step":3},{"step":3,"speaker":"男人的声音","content":"我是阿廖沙，蛇眼的负责人。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201004,"trial_step":4},{"step":4,"content":"电话里传来一个男人的声音，声线苍老低沉，略带口音。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201005,"trial_step":5},{"step":5,"content":"正是这个男人数分钟前向MBCC的办公处打来电话，拒绝与包括夜莺在内的人透露任何事情，只是要求与你——MBCC的局长通话。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201006,"trial_step":6},{"step":6,"content":"你好，我是MBCC的局长。不知道贵司特意打来电话有何贵干？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201007,"trial_step":7},{"step":7,"speaker":"阿廖沙","content":"我要征调一个人。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"content":"征调禁闭者？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"content":"做什么？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"speaker":"阿廖沙","content":"副议长雷根阁下近期要进行巡回演讲。他点名辰砂保护。","style":11,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"content":"恕我直言，征调禁闭者来保护要员不是什么合理要求。禁闭者无论在能力还是情绪上都具备高度不可控性……","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"speaker":"阿廖沙","content":"辰砂她不一样！","style":11,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"speaker":"阿廖沙","content":"……辰砂是这个行业最优秀的人才，征调她是雷根阁下本人的意思。","style":11,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"speaker":"阿廖沙","content":"征调文件很快就寄到你们那儿。","style":11,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"听筒里传来忙音，阿廖沙挂断了电话。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我准备好了，您随时可以审问我。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1110201},{"step":17,"content":"审查室里的辰砂主动向你搭话。她没有表露出攻击性，只是坐在那里，背脊挺得笔直、表情真挚，像个准备听你牢骚的朋友。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1110201},{"step":18,"content":"但她并不是你的朋友。这个叫辰砂的家伙接受过严苛的军事训练，在雇佣兵和安保业界颇有名头。她和煦的样子可能只是伪装。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1110201},{"step":19,"options":["我需要了解你过去的事情","别紧张只是聊聊"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201021,"trial_step":21,"course":3,"drawing":1110201,"choices":[{"text":"我需要了解你过去的事情","goto":22},{"text":"别紧张只是聊聊","goto":24}]},{"step":20,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"是指我过去犯下的罪行吗？","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1110201,"next":[26]},{"step":21,"content":"不完全是。我想听你多说些关于自己的事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1110201},{"step":22,"content":"辰砂笑了笑，或许并不相信你这番说辞。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1110201},{"step":23,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"没问题，您想聊些什么？","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1110201},{"step":24,"content":"面对辰砂友善的态度，你感到十分轻松，顺手拿起了桌上的第一份资料。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1110201},{"step":25,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":26,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":27,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":28,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":29,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":30,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":31,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":32,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":27,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":33,"content":"初期从事雇佣兵任务完成率100%，后期成为新城议会安保顾问后执勤期间伤亡率为0，辰砂的整个职业生涯都让人挑不出毛病。这份履历完美到让人没什么聊它的欲望。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1110201},{"step":34,"content":"你翻看了好几分钟，才终于发现了一点有趣的“话题”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1110201},{"step":35,"options":["聊聊这件有趣的案子"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201030,"trial_step":30,"course":3,"drawing":1110201,"choices":[{"text":"聊聊这件有趣的案子","goto":31}]},{"step":36,"content":"106年2月14日，你孤身一人从十几个绑匪手中救出了潘德议员的女儿？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1110201},{"step":37,"content":"辰砂略微思索了一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1110203},{"step":38,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"您是说希露德小姐吗？","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1110203},{"step":39,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我的确参与过营救她的行动，但不是孤身一人。蛇眼的队友给予了我非常重要的情报支持。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1110203},{"step":40,"content":"你又瞥了一眼文件，接下来就是这起事件中最有趣的部分了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1110201},{"step":41,"content":"这件事后来被新城的媒体反复报导，你也间接出了一波名吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1110201},{"step":42,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"对我们这个行业的人来说，因为工作原因出名不是件坏事。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1110201},{"step":43,"content":"报告上说出名的主要原因是……潘德小姐在电视上公开向你表达了好感？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1110201},{"step":44,"content":"辰砂的表情一下子变得有些窘迫。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1110204},{"step":45,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我……呃，希露德小姐她大概是把我错认成了男士，我事后向她解释过了……","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1110204},{"step":46,"content":"是吗？前些日子你被MBCC收容时，她还给我们寄了抗议信，要求立刻释放你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1110204},{"step":47,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1110204},{"step":48,"content":"而且，在新城的权贵圈子里，你的拥趸似乎不在少数。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1110204},{"step":49,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1110204},{"step":50,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我只能说……非常感谢她们的好意。但是……很抱歉，我不会对自己的保护对象产生恋爱情感，这样太不负责也太不专业了。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1110204},{"step":51,"content":"辰砂的反应相当有趣。不过，尴尬的话题可以到此为止了。时间宝贵，你还需了解更多情报。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1110204},{"step":52,"options":["询问两年前发生的事"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201047,"trial_step":47,"course":3,"drawing":1110204,"choices":[{"text":"询问两年前发生的事","goto":48}]},{"step":53,"content":"看来直到两年前，你都很受新城权贵的赏识。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1110204},{"step":54,"content":"牵扯到这部分话题，刚刚还有些窘迫的辰砂迅速平静下来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1110201},{"step":55,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我很感谢那些能给予我充分信任的雇主，但保护他们只是职责，与是否赏识我无关。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1110201},{"step":56,"content":"辰砂的回答耐人寻味，两年前的事情应该没那么简单。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1110201},{"step":57,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":58,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":59,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":60,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":61,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":62,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":63,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1110201},{"step":64,"content":"文件中描述了两年前辛迪加绿茵街区发生的一起暴动事件。关于暴动的起因和后续都语焉不详，唯一记载详细的桥段是“安保顾问在保护新城访问团时擅离职守，后成为禁闭者受到通缉。”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1110201},{"step":65,"content":"辰砂阅读着你递给她的文件，露出了有些无奈的笑容。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1110201},{"step":66,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"他们是这么解释这件事的吗……","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1110201},{"step":67,"options":["质疑辰砂的选择","质疑雇主的做法"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201056,"trial_step":56,"course":3,"drawing":1110201,"choices":[{"text":"质疑辰砂的选择","goto":57},{"text":"质疑雇主的做法","goto":60}]},{"step":68,"content":"你受到了议会的雇佣，却在关键时刻擅离职守。这不是你一贯的作风。有什么隐情吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1110201},{"step":69,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"没什么可狡辩的。上面记载的事情的确发生过。我独自离队，把访问团丢给了蛇眼的队友。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1110201},{"step":70,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"之后，我成为了禁闭者……我不会否认犯下过这些罪行——虽然我并不会为之后悔。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1110201,"next":[64]},{"step":71,"content":"仅仅是擅离职守就剥夺一切职务、遭到通缉，新城的权贵未免太不近人情了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1110201},{"step":72,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"并不是这样，我的确辜负了雇主的信任，把他们扔给了蛇眼的队友。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1110201},{"step":73,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"在离队期间我感染狂厄，这之后还试图返回议会驻地，引发了恐慌……这的确不是职业人士该做的。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1110201},{"step":74,"content":"辰砂的回答并没有解释自己当初的动机。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1110201},{"step":75,"content":"能告诉我你离队的原因吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1110201},{"step":76,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1110202},{"step":77,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"……那是一场帮派战争。黑帮成员闯入了平民街区。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1110202},{"step":78,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我见识过他们的行事风格，底层的帮众不会因为面对的是女人和孩子就放过他们……","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1110202},{"step":79,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"我没法放着那些平民不管。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1110202},{"step":80,"content":"辰砂顿了顿，继续说道。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1110202},{"step":81,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"他们的目标不是访问团，小股的暴徒也构不成威胁。正因如此，我才能放心把访问团交给同事。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1110202},{"step":82,"options":["结果怎么样？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201071,"trial_step":71,"course":3,"drawing":1110202,"choices":[{"text":"结果怎么样？","goto":72}]},{"step":83,"content":"辰砂欣慰地笑了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1110201},{"step":84,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"救下不少人。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1110201},{"step":85,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"虽然出了些意外，但不影响结果。重要的是，他们还活着。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1110201},{"step":86,"content":"代价就是，你成为了禁闭者，失去工作，被议会通缉……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1110201},{"step":87,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"再来一次，我还是会这么选。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1110201},{"step":88,"content":"辰砂描述的与你所知的事实没有出入，也能解释为何议会的文件隐瞒了渎职发生前的事情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1110201},{"step":89,"content":"这样看来，当初议会的做法更多是杀鸡儆猴。如今风头早已过去，重新启用辰砂也在情理之中。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1110201},{"step":90,"options":["你还有机会回去"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201079,"trial_step":79,"course":3,"drawing":1110201,"choices":[{"text":"你还有机会回去","goto":80}]},{"step":91,"content":"你的能力毋庸置疑，他们不会这么放弃你的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1110201},{"step":92,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"有些事情是没法挽回的。","voice":["vo_trial_110201_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_beisefenni_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":210201081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1110203},{"step":93,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"就算议会可以对我睁一只眼闭一只眼，我的队友……蛇眼的